### ============================================================
### PRODUCTION REST API TESTS (Live Azure Environment)
### ============================================================

# Live Azure Backend URL
@baseUrl = https://workout-logger-api-gce5erdshpb7c3gs.uaenorth-01.azurewebsites.net/api

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================================

### 1a. Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ProfTest",
  "email": "professor@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1b. Login (run this first to get a token for the other routes)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "professor@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Auto-Extract Token Variable (Do not click this, it happens automatically)
@token = {{loginRequest.response.body.data.token}}

### 1c. Get User Profile (Tests if the auto-token worked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 2. EXERCISE MANAGEMENT (Eyad)
### ============================================================

### 2a. Create a Custom Exercise
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dumbbell Hammer Curls",
  "muscleGroup": "arms",
  "description": "Bicep isolation exercise."
}

### 2b. Get All Exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2c. Import Exercises from External API (ExerciseDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/external/search?name=squat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 3. WORKOUT SESSION LOG (Fares)
### ============================================================

### 3a. Log a Workout Session
# (Requires a valid exerciseId from the 'Get All Exercises' request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Upper Body Day",
  "date": "2024-05-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseId": "651a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e", 
      "sets": 3,
      "reps": 10,
      "weight": 25
    }
  ]
}

### 3b. Get All Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 4. WORKOUT NOTES (Saif)
### ============================================================

### 4a. Add a Note to a Session (Includes Profanity Filter API Test)
# (Requires a valid sessionId from 'Get All Sessions' request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/session/651a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This workout was incredibly hard. The squats were bullshit but I pushed through."
}

### 4b. Get Notes for a Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/session/651a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 5. PROGRESS & ANALYTICS (Abdelrahman)
### ============================================================

### 5a. Get Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5b. Get Weekly Volume Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/volume/weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5c. Get Muscle Group Frequency
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/frequency?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}